    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through campaigns as a warrior of humanity against the demonic corruption in fast-paced movement FPS combat. As you progress deeper the horde gets stronger but your arsenal of weapons is more than enough to prevail. If the challenge is arduous still, gather warriors online and/or split screen to triumph as a team of up to 4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No skill tree, no stats, no grind, instant fun. Only shooting and surviving matter, so come join your brothers in arms and unleash destruction.</p>",
